{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31175","headline":"春雨 · 薛能","name":"春雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"电阔照潺潺，惊流往复还。\n远声如有洞，迷色似无山。\n利物乾坤内，幷风竹树间。\n静思来朔漠，愁望满柴关。\n迸湿消尘虑，吹风触疾颜。\n谁知草茅迳，沾此尚虚闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}